# E.L.S.A. headers

This folder contains project headers. Key modules:

- `elsa_config.h`: Compile-time defaults and feature flags (override via `platformio.ini` build flags).
- `runtime_config.h`: Runtime-config values used by the web UI.
- `animation_engine.h`: Beat-to-wave rendering entrypoint.
- `animation_manager.h`: Animation frame sets and auto switching logic.
- `wave_position.h`: Wave physics, spacing, and lifetime.
- `waveform.h`, `frame_interpolation.h`: Wave envelope + frame rendering.
- `audio_processor.h`: I2S capture, FFT, beat detection.
- `audio_scheduler.h`: Audio task/scheduler wrapper.
- `controls.h`: Button handling.
- `hair_strip.h`: Independent hair strip animation.
- `networking.h`, `wifi_config.h`, `ota_config.h`: Wi-Fi + OTA setup.
- `web_telemetry.h`, `web_telemetry_page.h`: Web UI + endpoints.
- `wifi_secrets.h`, `ota_secrets.h`: Local secrets (gitignored); see `wifi_secrets.example.h`.
